{"candidate_identity":"1b9a0c4c87d1502d3288c9abae47ddeaa8ab1a4a1fa7184e6e9b69f3884484eb","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"30e79ca207a2406f2081f98c61a216ad5b1c977d4811597051f112e1db6a9bca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3258d5df5fd166af0371a30c218c2da05b4424054be6bfebf1d6dda35ec8c7ce","logical_entry_identity":"1a2856b15bf1b48b92a401bb7189e65f5393e103e210fb20d1c999fe33e0efdc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I shall, thank you, my lady.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我会的，谢谢你，我的女士。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6cf34765e32936cccc4e756c6d696f25783835c9a14e76833fe48bb266993546","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"325b414a67bd86f3753bd6b5d9c786221941d5213e7ba24784707942bc697ddc","logical_entry_identity":"7ad75c1f0b0d05dd02b92405cd8dd0ff781ebc9b9d2de358034bd2aafdafc771","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have accomplished great deeds, but if you enter the infinite dungeon there will be no way back. You will go on and on until you meet your glorious death.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你已经完成了你的伟大使命，不过当你进入无尽地下城之后就永远不能再回来，你只有不断地前进直到你光荣地死去。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"78ceba352768f35b63b6eb4bf1a24d2d9319e3af636e8f78b4ed5725f1285fb8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"325d3ff73911139e1dcafb8016d5c1cc2fb37a36ebcead0181722eb850585d30","logical_entry_identity":"492e1d24243f760d13183fe1a85c05d40e9c1ab8b72e558a488ae467c3719d40","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your Hymns now focus darkness near you, which increases your darkness damage by %d%% and does %0.2f darkness damage to anyone who hits you in melee.\n\t\tThese values scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"圣诗让暗影集中在你身边，你的黑暗伤害增加 %d%%，并对所有近战攻击你的敌人造成 %0.2f 暗属性伤害。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"94eb9cbc66e69494abd318932d00d9b511ca9fef9c68bd1fa01f33e7157d948c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"32644f04ebca5f7b2b33bf3ccb4edb3085c72888f2865152a0ec85b197992ee0","logical_entry_identity":"00be9663c80ca20d00ff92460dd6ef3fdd255c6443f2750204af98ae354935d8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"[Boss]","source_tag":"_t","target":"[Boss战]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c60f8c3685fc332ee95ddd8307c228b20792e90e4971788d5f3501888942bc24","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"326a782567841a139fb29ec10442b7b468625a1e42ff89bc337812ba87b61beb","logical_entry_identity":"d1b7bc597a1d616b3cee0209dde030d3a46d864d004009b89d4af744ab8bb7f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You use the %s on the pedestal. There is a distant 'clonk' sound.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你在基座上使用了 %s。你听到远处传来一声“咔嗒”声。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5070de8011d90bc99ffe1a386e97b78513d268765aa3222c8736f1567f55011b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"326e1644f116469aa4ef967688dff9129e5bf002f9577932c80e938a17d33f11","logical_entry_identity":"457b9799ab710701f253524faf1d739aba658c8cb81c23852d4ee2e4e3419c96","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nAs you walk forward, you hear the increasingly loud cheers coming from outside.\nAs you step into the arena, the scorching sun blinds your eyes temporarily.\nYou look up, and meet your target eye to eye: The Master of the Arena, carefully examining\nthe newcomer. He smirks, and starts looking at the other fighters with interest.\nWhoever defeats the Master of Arena will achieve utmost glory. \nDetermined to win, you draw your weapons and advance defiantly. \nThe public roars in anticipation....\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n当你往前走时，你听到外面传来越来越高的欢呼声。\n当你走入竞技场，灼烈的阳光暂使你一时睁不开眼睛。\n你抬头往前看，与你的对手四目相对。\n竞技场主宰，小心翼翼地打量着这个新来的对手。\n他得意地一笑，并开始把他的兴趣转移到其他的斗士身上。\n击败竞技场主宰的人将获得最高的荣誉。\n怀着必胜的决心，你拿起了你的武器，并勇敢的往前迈进。\n观众们在期待中发出震耳欲聋的欢呼……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"913b97cc7e353eb62c4a82084244dadb02d994f242703141d9adbae1240d3537","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"326e7631d6bdc0a39a5734e5024ef6c115c201323374817f39734b9771081911","logical_entry_identity":"cd1e6ae2ee5e0266a32030fadd83b125405b39ee2a0fd78f302dc569f60e4ee2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The remnants of a damaged timeline, this blade shifts and fades at random.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把剑由一段损坏的时间线构成，它在不断的出入相位现实。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a757b8a02a5cc07b8482135e11e87029f4ac232b080417f559102e39f9e556b6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3272072561d702eca1d5822f36ff66197c260c1f2008c56fc3050cec57d57805","logical_entry_identity":"034c2e50536069d86db4542722c7bb71adfbbb2ba28686da42c1b8bce26f374f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lay a trap that releases a burst of antimagic energies (radius 2), draining up to %d mana, %d vim, %d positive and %d negative energies from affected targets, while inflicting up to %0.2f arcane damage based on the resources drained, silencing for %d turns, and removing up to %d beneficial magical effects or sustains.\n\t\tThe draining effect scales with your Willpower, and you must have 25 Willpower to prepare this trap.\n\t\tThis trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"放置一个陷阱，触发后释放半径 2 的反魔能量波，吸取至多 %d 法力 , %d 活力 , %d 正能量和 %d 负能量，并造成至多 %0.2f 奥术伤害（基于吸取能量），沉默 %d 回合，并解除至多 %d 项正面魔法状态或者维持技能。\n\t\t吸取效果受意志加成，你需要 25 点意志来使用该技能。\n\t\t该陷阱可以被设置为直接激活，也可以被诱饵激活。%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b87ec28a16497b092914d8c18946e00f4ea8546a8afde4ef5c2457767773912c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3275e94571b994481366a9747dff46674f6fd1d1aefdf627fad097991ff158f7","logical_entry_identity":"621814c28ae9f8195a30b69fbe258e8297579d4fe5f6ceb419d9ea1ec7466f89","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Redhead Flip","source_tag":"_t","target":"红色翻转胡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1537b0cee70b0f7a9182bd3764a1fd496c89222cbd0cf91a539d224b5fe5c625","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3276bf222e5b904216f2ac47ed098774cc9c24758472ddd6450a3327ff7084e1","log